{"3138560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ski Royale", "steam_appid": 3138560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race on skis and snowboards with your friends and other ski and snowboard players on wacky and wonderful mountains! Customize your avatar and choose from penguins, wizards, robots, and other fantastic creatures and characters! Watch out for trees, rocks, yetis, and...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ski Royale includes different game modes for you to enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elimination mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ski Royale also supports multiplatform, so you can play with friends on Android, iOS, Windows, MacOS, and Linux!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race on skis and snowboards with your friends and other ski and snowboard players on wacky and wonderful mountains! Customize your avatar and choose from penguins, wizards, robots, and other fantastic creatures and characters! Watch out for trees, rocks, yetis, and...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ski Royale includes different game modes for you to enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elimination mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ski Royale also supports multiplatform, so you can play with friends on Android, iOS, Windows, MacOS, and Linux!</p>", "short_description": "Test your speed, reflexes, strategy, and intelligence in this fast-paced action arcade ski &amp; snowboard experience!", "supported_languages":